<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Lifestyle Email Campaign Rebuild — Case Study | Peter Cadimas</title>

<meta name="description" content="A Lifestyle Email Marketing case study by Peter Cadimas focused on campaign rebuilding, weekly consistency, audience engagement, CTA optimization, and conversion.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#0B1220;
    --blue:#2563EB;
    --sky:#38BDF8;
    --bg:#F8FAFC;
    --slate:#334155;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --border:#E2E8F0;
    --max:1160px;
    --content-max:780px;
  }

  *{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
  }

  html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
  }

  body{
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--slate);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    line-height:1.5;
  }

  a{
    color:inherit;
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  ul{
    list-style:none;
  }

  img{
    max-width:100%;
    display:block;
  }

  .mono{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
  }

  .wrap{
    max-width:var(--max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }

  .content{
    max-width:var(--content-max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .wrap,
    .content{
      padding:0 20px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------- utility ---------- */

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }

  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:14px;
    height:1px;
    background:var(--blue);
    display:inline-block;
  }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */

  header{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:100;
    min-height:90px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    background:rgba(248,250,252,.85);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }

  nav{
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding:20px 0;
  }

  .logo{
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:16px;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    color:var(--navy);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
  }

  .avatar{
    width:36px;
    height:36px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--border);
    border:1px solid #CBD5E1;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }

  .back-link{
    margin-left:auto;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--navy);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    transition:color .2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover{
    color:var(--blue);
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */

  .cs-hero{
    padding:120px 0 100px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .cs-hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-200px;
    right:-200px;
    width:600px;
    height:600px;
    background:radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(37,99,235,.10) 0%,
      rgba(56,189,248,0) 70%
    );
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .cs-hero .content{
    max-width:var(--content-max);
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }

  .cs-hero h1{
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);
    line-height:1.06;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:22px 0;
  }

  .cs-hero .lede{
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--slate);
    max-width:650px;
  }

  .cs-tags{
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:32px;
  }

  .cs-tag{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  .nda-note{
    margin-top:32px;
    font-size:13.5px;
    line-height:1.65;
    color:var(--slate);
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-left:3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:18px 20px;
  }

  .nda-note strong{
    color:var(--navy);
    font-weight:700;
  }

  /* ---------- snapshot ---------- */

  .snapshot{
    max-width:var(--content-max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
    transform:translateY(-1px);
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .snapshot{
      padding:0 20px;
    }
  }

  .snapshot-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--border);
    gap:1px;
    box-shadow:0 16px 40px -30px rgba(11,18,32,.15);
  }

  @media(max-width:760px){
    .snapshot-grid{
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }
  }

  .snap-cell{
    background:var(--white);
    padding:20px 18px;
  }

  .snap-cell .label{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }

  .snap-cell .val{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  /* ---------- sections ---------- */

  .cs-section{
    padding:110px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
  }

  @media(max-width:760px){
    .cs-section{
      padding:70px 0;
    }
  }

  .cs-section:last-of-type{
    border-bottom:none;
  }

  .cs-section .content{
    max-width:var(--content-max);
  }

  .cs-section .num{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--blue);
    margin-bottom:14px;
    display:block;
  }

  .cs-section h2{
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);
    line-height:1.15;
    color:var(--navy);
    letter-spacing:-.01em;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }

  .cs-section h3{
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:19px;
    line-height:1.3;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin:32px 0 10px;
  }

  .cs-section p{
    font-size:15.5px;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }

  .cs-section ul{
    margin:0 0 20px;
    padding-left:20px;
    list-style:disc;
  }

  .cs-section ul li{
    font-size:15.5px;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-bottom:9px;
  }

  /* ---------- quote ---------- */

  .strategy-quote{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--white);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:30px;
    margin:28px 0;
  }

  .strategy-quote .quote-label{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--sky);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }

  .strategy-quote p{
    color:var(--white);
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.45;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0;
  }

  /* ---------- flow ---------- */

  .flow{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--navy);
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:22px;
    text-align:center;
    line-height:2.1;
    margin:24px 0;
  }

  .flow .arrow{
    color:var(--blue);
  }

  /* ---------- cards ---------- */

  .audit-card{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    transition:
      transform .2s ease,
      box-shadow .2s ease,
      border-color .2s ease;
  }

  .audit-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 18px 40px -28px rgba(11,18,32,.18);
    border-color:#CBD5E1;
  }

  .audit-card h3{
    margin-top:0;
  }

  /* ---------- KPI ---------- */

  .kpi-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));
    gap:14px;
    margin-top:20px;
  }

  .kpi{
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top:11px;
  }

  .kpi .k-label{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  .kpi .k-val{
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--navy);
    margin-top:4px;
  }

  /* ---------- pillar list ---------- */

  .pillar-list{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:14px;
  }

  .pillar-item{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:22px;
    transition:
      transform .2s ease,
      box-shadow .2s ease,
      border-color .2s ease;
  }

  .pillar-item:hover{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow:0 18px 40px -28px rgba(11,18,32,.16);
    border-color:#CBD5E1;
  }

  .pillar-item .p-name{
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--navy);
    font-size:15px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }

  .pillar-item .p-detail{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  .pillar-item .p-detail strong{
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  /* ---------- results ---------- */

  .results-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:16px;
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .results-grid{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
  }

  .result-card{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:var(--white);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:28px;
  }

  .result-card.primary{
    grid-column:span 2;
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .result-card.primary{
      grid-column:span 1;
    }
  }

  .result-card h4{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--sky);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }

  .result-card .big-number{
    font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,64px);
    line-height:1;
    font-weight:800;
    color:var(--white);
    letter-spacing:-.03em;
    margin:6px 0 10px;
  }

  .result-card .result-description{
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    margin:0;
  }

  .result-card .r-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:9px 0;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    font-size:14px;
    gap:20px;
  }

  .result-card .r-row:first-of-type{
    border-top:none;
  }

  .result-card .r-row .r-val{
    font-weight:700;
    color:var(--white);
    text-align:right;
  }

  /* ---------- before after ---------- */

  .ba-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:20px;
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .ba-grid{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
  }

  .ba-card{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:26px;
    background:var(--white);
  }

  .ba-card.after{
    border-color:var(--blue);
  }

  .ba-card h4{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }

  .ba-card.after h4{
    color:var(--blue);
  }

  .ba-card ul{
    padding-left:18px;
    margin:0;
    list-style:disc;
  }

  .ba-card li{
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-bottom:9px;
  }

  /* ---------- takeaways ---------- */

  .takeaway{
    display:flex;
    gap:16px;
    align-items:flex-start;
    padding:20px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .takeaway:first-of-type{
    border-top:none;
  }

  .takeaway .t-num{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    color:var(--blue);
    font-size:14px;
    flex-shrink:0;
    width:26px;
  }

  .takeaway p{
    margin:0;
    font-size:15.5px;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  /* ---------- visual placeholder ---------- */

  .visual-slot{
    border:1px dashed #CBD5E1;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--white);
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
    margin:28px 0 0;
  }

  .visual-slot .v-label{
    font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue);
  }

  .visual-slot .v-desc{
    font-size:13.5px;
    color:var(--slate);
    margin-top:8px;
    max-width:500px;
    margin-left:auto;
    margin-right:auto;
  }

  /* ---------- footer CTA ---------- */

  .cs-footer-section{
    padding:20px 0 110px;
  }

  @media(max-width:760px){
    .cs-footer-section{
      padding:10px 0 70px;
    }
  }

  .cs-footer-cta{
    background:var(--navy);
    border-radius:28px;
    max-width:var(--max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:90px 60px;
    text-align:center;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }

  .cs-footer-cta::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-150px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:500px;
    height:400px;
    background:radial-gradient(
      circle,
      rgba(37,99,235,.25),
      rgba(56,189,248,0) 70%
    );
  }

  @media(max-width:760px){
    .cs-footer-cta{
      padding:60px 28px;
      border-radius:20px;
    }
  }

  .cs-footer-cta .inner{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }

  .cs-footer-cta .eyebrow{
    justify-content:center;
    color:var(--sky);
  }

  .cs-footer-cta .eyebrow::before{
    background:var(--sky);
  }

  .cs-footer-cta h2{
    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);
    line-height:1.1;
    color:var(--white);
    margin:20px auto 28px;
    max-width:640px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.01em;
  }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    border-radius:11px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .2s ease;
    border:1px solid transparent;
  }

  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--blue);
    color:var(--white);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover{
    background:var(--sky);
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  .btn-secondary{
    background:transparent;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
    color:var(--white);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover{
    background:var(--white);
    color:var(--navy);
  }

  .cta-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */

  footer.site-footer{
    padding:0 0 40px;
  }

  .footer-inner{
    max-width:var(--max);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px;
  }

  .footer-inner .mono{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--slate);
  }

  @media(max-width:640px){
    .footer-inner{
      padding:0 20px;
    }
  }

  /* ---------- focus ---------- */

  a:focus-visible,
  button:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--blue);
    outline-offset:3px;
    border-radius:4px;
  }

  /* ---------- reduced motion ---------- */

  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{
      scroll-behavior:auto;
    }

    .audit-card,
    .pillar-item{
      transition:none;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <div class="logo">
      <img src="PeterCadimasHeadshot.png" class="avatar" alt="Peter Cadimas">
      PETER CADIMAS
    </div>

    <a href="index.html#work" class="back-link">
      ← BACK TO WORK
    </a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- =========================================================
       HERO
  ========================================================== -->

  <section class="cs-hero">
    <div class="content">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        CASE STUDY 02 / EMAIL MARKETING &amp; CAMPAIGN REBUILD
      </div>

      <h1>
        Lifestyle Email Campaign Rebuild — turning email into a consistent growth system.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede">
        A strategic email marketing rebuild focused on establishing a reliable
        weekly publishing rhythm, strengthening campaign structure, optimizing
        calls-to-action, and creating a repeatable system designed to improve
        audience engagement and conversion.
      </p>

      <div class="cs-tags">
        <span class="cs-tag">LIFESTYLE</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">EMAIL MARKETING</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">CAMPAIGN REBUILD</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">AUDIENCE ENGAGEMENT</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">CTA OPTIMIZATION</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">CONVERSION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="nda-note">
        <strong>Client Confidentiality Notice</strong><br>
        Due to client confidentiality, identifying brand information and selected
        campaign assets have been hidden or anonymized in this case study.
        The strategy, execution framework, and confirmed performance results
        presented reflect the work delivered.
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =========================================================
       PROJECT SNAPSHOT
  ========================================================== -->

  <div class="snapshot">

    <div class="snapshot-grid">

      <div class="snap-cell">
        <div class="label">Industry</div>
        <div class="val">Lifestyle</div>
      </div>

      <div class="snap-cell">
        <div class="label">Channel</div>
        <div class="val">Email Marketing</div>
      </div>

      <div class="snap-cell">
        <div class="label">Frequency</div>
        <div class="val">Weekly</div>
      </div>

      <div class="snap-cell">
        <div class="label">Publishing</div>
        <div class="val">Every Thursday</div>
      </div>

      <div class="snap-cell">
        <div class="label">Focus</div>
        <div class="val">Engagement · Conversion</div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>


  <!-- =========================================================
       01 OVERVIEW
  ========================================================== -->

  <section class="cs-section">

    <div class="content">

      <span class="num mono">01</span>

      <h2>
        Overview
      </h2>

      <p>
        The Lifestyle Email Campaign Rebuild was designed as a strategic
        optimization initiative rather than a simple email-sending task.
        The project focused on rebuilding the campaign around a consistent
        weekly communication system, with a deliberate commitment to publishing
        an email every Thursday.
      </p>

      <p>
        The objective was to transform email into a dependable marketing asset:
        one that consistently reaches the audience, provides relevant value,
        creates clear opportunities for action, and generates measurable data
        that can be used to improve future campaigns.
      </p>

      <div class="audit-card">

        <h3>
          Project Snapshot
        </h3>

        <div class="kpi-row">

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Industry</div>
            <div class="k-val">Lifestyle</div>
          </div>

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Channel</div>
            <div class="k-val">Email Marketing</div>
          </div>

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Frequency</div>
            <div class="k-val">Weekly</div>
          </div>

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Publishing Day</div>
            <div class="k-val">Thursday</div>
          </div>

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Click Rate Growth</div>
            <div class="k-val">+304.5%</div>
          </div>

          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k-label">Conversion Rate</div>
            <div class="k-val">23.3%</div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="visual-slot">

        <div class="v-label">
          Suggested Visual
        </div>

        <div class="v-desc">
          Hero screenshot of a representative weekly email. The visual should
          immediately communicate the campaign's polished structure, branding,
          hierarchy, and CTA design.
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- =========================================================
       02 CHALLENGE
  ========================================================== -->

  <section class="cs-section">

    <div class="content">

      <span class="num mono">02</span>

      <h2>
        The Challenge
      </h2>

      <p>
        The opportunity was not simply to send more emails. The larger challenge
        was to create a reliable communication rhythm and rebuild email as a
        repeatable marketing channel.
      </p>

      <p>
        Without a predictable publishing cadence, audience communication can
        become inconsistent and valuable opportunities to engage, educate,
        promote, and convert can be missed.
      </p>

      <div class="strategy-quote">

        <div class="quote-label">
          Strategic Question
        </div>

        <p>
